     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Sorry: obvious mistake. In the second example the third line should read:<div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">  nu &lt;- 2 *q<br></blockquote><div>as in the first example. </div></div></div>"
