he value of nu, as in:</div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"> Code1 &lt;- nimbleCode({</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">  q ~ dgamma(1,  scale = 1)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">  nu &lt;- 2 *qtilde1</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">  if(nu &lt; 2){</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">    xi &lt;- log(nu) </blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">  }</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">  else</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">    xi &lt;- nu / 2</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"m